{"id":"a4c4ae3ab0ef3bfc","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-hamiltonian-cycle-np-complete.md","title":"HAMILTONIAN-CYCLE is NP-Complete","display":"thm-hamiltonian-cycle-np-complete — HAMILTONIAN-CYCLE is NP-Complete","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-hamiltonian-cycle-np-complete","aliases":["28-thm-hamiltonian-cycle-np-complete","HAMILTONIAN-CYCLE is NP-Complete"],"display":"thm-hamiltonian-cycle-np-complete — HAMILTONIAN-CYCLE is NP-Complete","depends_on":["[[28-df-hamiltonian-cycle]]","[[28-df-3sat]]","[[28-df-np-complete]]","[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","[[28-thm-3sat-np-complete]]"],"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-hamiltonian-cycle-np-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-hamiltonian-cycle-np-complete</span><span>HAMILTONIAN-CYCLE is NP-Complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hamiltonian-cycle-np-complete — HAMILTONIAN-CYCLE is NP-Complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb808e04195f2bc5\" href=\"?note=bb808e04195f2bc5\" title=\"28-df-hamiltonian-cycle\">28-df-hamiltonian-cycle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5408daacba221251\" href=\"?note=5408daacba221251\" title=\"28-df-3sat\">28-df-3sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a9125ebbfdef91e\" href=\"?note=7a9125ebbfdef91e\" title=\"28-df-np-complete\">28-df-np-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14088421136f8182\" href=\"?note=14088421136f8182\" title=\"28-df-poly-reduction\">28-df-poly-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8db0d5d40e579d59\" href=\"?note=8db0d5d40e579d59\" title=\"28-thm-3sat-np-complete\">28-thm-3sat-np-complete</a></span></div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{3SAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{3SAT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HC}\">\\(\\mathrm{HC}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NPComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 采用本目录定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HC}\">\\(\\mathrm{HC}\\)</span> 是长度至少三的简单无向哈密顿环语言。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HC}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{3SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{HC}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HC}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{3SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{HC}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R6 证据边界：三点替换与指定端点闭环机制已复核；一般 SAT 到有向路径部件及上游 Cook–Levin 编码仍未完整独立审计。因此本条保留为有来源的定理记录，不作为本次已完整核验的证明依赖。</p>\n<p>原书先在定理2.17从 SAT 构造具有指定无入度起点和无出度终点的有向哈密顿路径实例，习题2.18要求转成无向路径及环。可把有向顶点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_{\\rm in}-v_{\\rm mid}-v_{\\rm out}\">\\(v_{\\rm in}-v_{\\rm mid}-v_{\\rm out}\\)</span>，把弧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\to v\">\\(u\\to v\\)</span> 替换为无向边 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_{\\rm out}v_{\\rm in}\">\\(u_{\\rm out}v_{\\rm in}\\)</span>；中间顶点度二强制连续通过三点部件，起终点强制整体方向。最后连接指定起点的 in 顶点与终点的 out 顶点，闭合成环；该边及度二约束把环反向拆回原有向路径。小退化输入及无效语法可直接映到固定真/假图。顶点排列是多项式证据。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理2.17、习题2.18；印刷53–54、65页；PDF79–80、91页。原书有向路径证明结构已读；无向三点替换及闭合为本地推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-hamiltonian-cycle","status":"resolved","id":"bb808e04195f2bc5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-hamiltonian-cycle]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-3sat","status":"resolved","id":"5408daacba221251","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-3sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"7a9125ebbfdef91e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-poly-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"14088421136f8182","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-3sat-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"8db0d5d40e579d59","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-3sat-np-complete]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{3SAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NPComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HC}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\\mathrm{3SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{HC}.","display":true},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"v_{\\rm in}-v_{\\rm mid}-v_{\\rm out}","display":false},{"tex":"u\\to v","display":false},{"tex":"u_{\\rm out}v_{\\rm in}","display":false}],"bytes":1912,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"NP 完全性：[[28-thm-clique-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-vertex-cover-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-independent-set-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-hamiltonian-cycle-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-3coloring-np-complete]]。"}],"outgoing":["bb808e04195f2bc5","5408